shed before operation admission\\\".into(),\\n        )\\n        .await;\\n        assert_eq!(\\n            canonical.into_inner().unwrap().role,\\n            if pending {\\n                AccountGroupRole::Invited\\n            } else {\\n                AccountGroupRole::Member\\n            }\\n        );\\n'''\\ns=s.replace(marker,insert+marker);p.write_text(s)\\np=Path('docs/ci-maintenance.md');s=p.read_text();needle='Give counterfactual source copies their own Cargo target directory.';assert needle in s;s=s.replace(needle,'Capture immutable precondition evidence before admitting an operation that can\\\\ninvalidate it. Published projections may legitimately become pending during a\\\\ncommit; a post-admission read cannot prove the operation\\\\'s initial role. Wait on\\\\nthe existing preparation owner within the original setup deadline and fail\\\\nunexpected errors instead of retrying the whole operation.\\\\n'+needle);p.write_text(s)\\nPY\\nRUSTUP_TOOLCHAIN=1.99.0 cargo fmt --all -- --check; git diff --check\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/kingsonwu/programming/OctopusGarage/mesh-talk/.worktrees/ci-critical-path\",\"max_output_tokens\":1000}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a1b8a7-3fc8-7460-a590-a3bb58793d59","create_time":1794160022.6778984}}}
