e runtime path.\\\\\\\"\\\\nCollocations: startup issue, handshake failure, config mismatch, reproduce the issue, verify the fix\\\\nCommon mistake: Use \\\\\\\"problem\\\\\\\" for general trouble; use \\\\\\\"issue\\\\\\\" for bugs, tickets, incidents, and engineering discussions.\\\\nIPA: issue /ˈɪʃuː/ or /ˈɪsjuː/ For programming-task conversations, prefer software-engineering English in the final note. Good sentence patterns: append an English note at the end; keep the behavior behind a small interface; make the failure path explicit; cache the result to avoid repeating the same expensive operation; this change belongs at the module boundary. Use the configured computer-English files as vocabulary hints, not as text to quote every time.\\\",\\n  \\\"domainReference\\\": {\\n    \\\"style\\\": \\\"software-engineering\\\",\\n    \\\"available\\\": false,\\n    \\\"terms\\\": [],\\n    \\\"examples\\\": [\\n      \\\"append an English note at the end\\\",\\n      \\\"keep the behavior behind a small interface\\\",\\n      \\\"make the failure path explicit\\\",\\n      \\\"cache the result to avoid repeating the same expensive operation\\\",\\n      \\\"this change belongs at the module boundary\\\"\\n    ],\\n    \\\"missingPaths\\\": []\\n  },\\n  \\\"cadence\\\": \\\"Force mode bypasses cooldown and daily-cap intent for teachable user prompts; follow the configured note depth and keep the note professional. Skip only when there is no meaningful wording improvement.\\\",\\n  \\\"policy\\\": {\\n    \\\"gateMode\\\": \\\"enforce\\\",\\n    \\\"intensity\\\": \\\"force\\\",\\n    \\\"cooldownMinutes\\\": 0,\\n    \\\"maxInlineCoachingPerDay\\\": 999,\\n    \\\"assistantEnglishNoteDepth\\\": \\\"rich\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"today\\\": {\\n    \\\"date\\\": \\\"2026-11-08\\\",\\n    \\\"coachingShown\\\": 0,\\n    \\\"remaining\\\": 999\\n  },\\n  \\\"cooldown\\\": {\\n    \\\"active\\\": false,\\n    \\\"lastShownAt\\\": \\\"2026-08-01T13:52:28.084Z\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"de